cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "climate-indices: R tools for computing climate indices from station data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R tools for computing climate indices from spreadsheet station
  data. Computes the Standardized Precipitation Index (SPI), the Standardized
  Precipitation Evapotranspiration Index (SPEI) with Thornthwaite potential
  evapotranspiration and the monthly climatic water balance, and the
  Streamflow Drought Index (SDI), each at multiple accumulation scales.
type: software
